    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "NEW TO THE MARKET - Harry Brann Auctioneers & Cherryfox Developments Ltd are delighted to announce the release of 3 luxury Town Houses at the very popular Arda na Deirge Development - Boasting panoramic views of Lough Derg & The Tipperary Hills from impressive balcony areas, the  A energy rated homes are located within walking distance of all amenities in the popular lakeside town of Killaloe - properties represent an ideal starter, downsizer or holiday home for the would-be purchaser - REGISTER YOUR INTEREST NOW AT info@harrybrann.com or call John Phelan on 086-8181583 or 061-376380.\r\n\r\nKillaloe, home of Brian Boru, the former High King of Ireland from 1002 to 1014, is situated on the banks of the River Shannon, amongst the Slieve Bernagh mountains of Clare and the Arra hills of Tipperary at the lower end of beautiful Lough Derg. Killaloe and its twin town of Ballina are linked by an impressive 13 arch bridge which the River Shannon passes through enroute to the Atlantic Ocean."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation to include; \r\nGround Floor -  Entrance Hall, Lounge, Kitchen/Dining Area, Guest WC & Utility. \r\nFirst Floor - Bedroom 1,2 & 3 - 1 En-suite & Family Bathroom & Balcony Area\r\nSecond Floor - Bedroom 4 - En-suite & Balcony Area"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "HOUSE TYPE C - 176 SQ MTS /1,895 SQ FT -  PRICE ON APPLICATION\r\nPanoramic views of Lough Derg from First & Second-Floor Balconies\r\nA2 energy rating\r\nAir-To-Water heating as main heat source - (Under-floor on ground floor & radiators on upper floors)\r\nHome Bond \r\n\r\nHouse Specifications\r\nKitchen: Choice of colour, worktop, single bowl sink and taps & integrated extractor.\r\nUtility: With fitted units.\r\n\r\nTiling:\r\nMain Bathroom: Floor tiles, both sides of bath to ceiling & WBH splash back.\r\nEn-suite: Fully wall & floor tiled, WBH splash back.\r\n\r\nFloor Finishes:\r\nDownstairs WC: Floor tiles\r\nKitchen/Dining: Floor tiles\r\nUtility: Floor tiles\r\nBedrooms: Choice of 12mm laminate flooring or carpet\r\nEntrance Hallway: Choice of 12mm laminate flooring or carpet\r\nLounge: Choice of 12mm laminate flooring or carpet\r\nStairs & Landing: Carpets\r\n\r\nPainting: Fully painted in a choice of 2 colours internally. One colour choice externally\r\n\r\nLandscaping: Front & rear gardens fully landscaped including seeded lawns. Tarmacadam driveways. Guest Parking.\r\n\r\nThere's plenty to do in the bustling twin-towns, it's a wonderful place for families with lots of activities and places of interest nearby. Take a lakeside walk, a lake cruise on the Spirit of Killaloe or hire a boat and go fishing. All sports are catered for to include hurling, Gaelic football, rugby & soccer. Shoppers will enjoy an eclectic mix of shops and boutiques or the opportunity to buy fresh produce and crafts at the Farmer's Market each Sunday, not to mention the large number of award winning restaurants & pubs - discoverkillaloe.ie"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Arda Na Deirge is located in the popular lakeside town of Killaloe on the shores of Lower Lough Derg. Access to the existing development of 50 houses is opposite the Kincora Kids Creche (V94H510). University of Limerick is only a 30 minute drive away (30kms), Shannon 42 minutes (55kms), Nenagh 23 minutes (22kms) & J27 M7 Motorway 15 minutes (13kms). Explore other properties and sales history in Killaloe."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Contact John Phelan on 086-8181583 or 061-376380"
      }
    ],
